# Trade the Helm: "Exchange control of target artifact or creature you control and target artifact or creature an opponent
# controls." (CR 701.12). Bot1's Ornithopter goes to Bot2 and Bot2's Llanowar Elves comes to Bot1; ownership is unchanged. A land
# (Bot2's Island) is refused as the opponent's target, and so is Bot1's own Mox Jet: the second target must be an opponent's.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Ornithopter
Trade the Helm
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Island
Llanowar Elves
Island x17

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
! Bot1.Hand.Trade the Helm.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter; Bot2.Battlefield.Island)
! Bot1.Hand.Trade the Helm.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter; Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet)
Bot1.Hand.Trade the Helm.Cast
Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Llanowar Elves; Mox Emerald; Mox Jet; Mox Pearl; Mox Ruby; Mox Sapphire
Bot2.Battlefield = Island; Mox Emerald; Ornithopter
Bot1.Graveyard = Trade the Helm
